          'At the exoteric level, this inner process is reflected in the outer relationship between man and woman. The Gnostic tradition takes both levels seriously: the outer relationship and the inner work are not separate. A relationship approached with genuine awareness, respect, and the understanding of what is actually at stake in the meeting of two souls can become a genuine initiatic vehicle — one of the most profound and most available paths of transformation.',
